x=3  sum=6   sum-tar=6-3=3    hs has  3? ✅   count=2   hs={0,1,3,6}
x=4  sum=10  sum-tar=10-3=7   hs has  7? ❌   hs={0,1,3,6,10}

return count = 2 ✅
